SUMMARY:Berryessa Gap Vineyards 19th Annual Paella Cook-Off
DESCRIPTION:The 19th Annual Paella Cookoff is happening November 7th! Join us for one of Berryessa Gap’s most beloved traditions as talented chefs fire up their pans and compete for the title of Best Paella of 2026! \nCome hungry and enjoy delicious paella\, Berryessa Gap wines\, and an unforgettable evening of food\, wine\, and friendly competition.
