UID:10015298-1794079800-1794087000@visityolo.com
SUMMARY:Journey Revisited - Classic Journey Sound
DESCRIPTION:Preserve Presents: Winters Live Music Series at Winters Opera House \nJoin us for an unforgettable evening with the Winters Live music series\, a collaboration between Preserve and Winters Live\, hosted at the stunning Winters Opera House. \nGet ready to experience the ultimate tribute to one of rock’s greatest bands! Journey Revisited brings the legendary sound of Journey’s Steve Perry era to life—faithfully recreating the soaring vocals\, signature harmonies\, and powerful guitar riffs that defined a generation. With a setlist packed with timeless hits like Don’t Stop Believin’\, Faithfully\, Lights\, and Separate Ways\, this high-energy performance will have you singing along from start to finish. \nShow starts at 7:30PM\, enjoy happy house at Preserve 6:30PM-7:30PM \nTickets are $35 -$45\, to purchase click here.
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/journey-revisited-classic-journey-sound/
LOCATION:Winters Opera House\, 13 Main Street\, Winters\, 95694\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/jefferson-santos-fCEJGBzAkrU-unsplash-2-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
